{"seq":3,"slug":"rental-fraud-deposit-auth-risk-control","title":"租赁欺诈识别与押金授权风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/booking-pricing-deposit-risk/rental-fraud-deposit-auth-risk-control","wordCount":2977,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"租赁欺诈识别与押金授权风控\">租赁欺诈识别与押金授权风控</h1><p>零售的欺诈损失上限是「一单货值」，租赁的损失上限却是「资产被长期占用、损坏或消失」——一台相机租出去坏账，损失的不只是货值，还有本可产生的数十次租金与残值。所以租赁风控的核心不是「要不要发货」，而是「要不要把这台序列化资产在某个时段交给这个人」，且必须在<strong>付款之前</strong>把大部分风险定价掉。占位与冲突判定见<a href=\"availability-calendar-booking-hold-engine\">可用性日历与预约占位并发引擎</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-租赁欺诈的三类风险面\">核心概念：租赁欺诈的三类风险面</h2><p>租赁欺诈是三个时间点各不相同的风险叠加。<strong>取件前欺诈（pre-fulfillment fraud）</strong>：盗卡、盗用身份下预订，意图不是租、而是拿到资产后转卖，特征是高价品类、急迫取件、与账单地址不符的取件地。<strong>履约中与归还欺诈</strong>：押真实身份租到手，然后损坏、逾期不还、或以「以旧换新」归还一台外观相似但序列号不同的资产。<strong>拒付欺诈（chargeback fraud）</strong>：既有恶意（租完再谎称未授权），也有真实的「友好欺诈」（忘记这笔预授权、或对归还后仍在的押金占用不满发起争议）。</p>\n<p>三类的防线不同：取件前靠身份与支付信号在<strong>授权阶段</strong>拦截，履约中靠序列号与取还证据链，拒付靠<strong>授权时埋下的证据</strong>与卡组织责任转移规则。租赁争议极难赢：Stripe 指出欺诈类争议「有利解决非常困难，预防才是关键」；卡组织对租赁专属理由码（如 Amex 的 M10「Car Rental—Significant Damage, Theft, or Loss of Use」）要求商户提交损伤、盗窃、使用损失的完整证据（docs.stripe.com/disputes/categories）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[预订请求&lt;br/&gt;资产 + 时段 + 身份] --&gt; B[身份核验&lt;br/&gt;证件 + 活体 + 设备]&#10;  B --&gt; C{风险评分}&#10;  C --&gt;|低风险| D[常规押金授权]&#10;  C --&gt;|中风险| E[提高押金 + 3DS 挑战&lt;br/&gt;人工复核]&#10;  C --&gt;|高风险| F[拒单 或 要求替代凭证]&#10;  D --&gt; G[授权成功&lt;br/&gt;占用可用额度]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[取件 序列号绑定]&#10;  H --&gt; I{归还状态}&#10;  I --&gt;|完好| J[释放押金授权]&#10;  I --&gt;|损坏/逾期| K[部分请款&lt;br/&gt;capture &lt;= auth]\">graph TD\n  A[预订请求&lt;br/&gt;资产 + 时段 + 身份] --&gt; B[身份核验&lt;br/&gt;证件 + 活体 + 设备]\n  B --&gt; C{风险评分}\n  C --&gt;|低风险| D[常规押金授权]\n  C --&gt;|中风险| E[提高押金 + 3DS 挑战&lt;br/&gt;人工复核]\n  C --&gt;|高风险| F[拒单 或 要求替代凭证]\n  D --&gt; G[授权成功&lt;br/&gt;占用可用额度]\n  E --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[取件 序列号绑定]\n  H --&gt; I{归还状态}\n  I --&gt;|完好| J[释放押金授权]\n  I --&gt;|损坏/逾期| K[部分请款&lt;br/&gt;capture &lt;= auth]</pre><p>风险评分是带权重的线性模型再过 sigmoid：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sigma(\\sum_{j} w_j x_j + b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化信号（设备指纹与账单国一致度、历史租还完好率、订单价值分位、卡 BIN 属性等）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 越过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接拒，落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[R_M, R_H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 加验证与押金，低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 走免打扰路径。价值不在精确，而在<strong>可解释、可回滚</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"押金授权-延后请款与授权有效期\">押金授权：延后请款与授权有效期</h2><p>押金的本质是<strong>一笔延后请款的授权（authorization，冻结额度但未实际扣款）</strong>，而非收款。硬约束是：从下单冻结到归还后结算，持有期不能超过卡组织允许的授权有效期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，否则授权在请款前失效、资金被释放、你既收不到押金也无法扣损。授权与请款分离（capture-after）是押金的技术底座；Stripe 说明未请款的授权到期后会释放，支付状态转为 <code>canceled</code>（docs.stripe.com/payments/place-a-hold-on-a-payment-method）。不同卡组织与受理环境的授权有效期差异很大，跨境长租必须逐卡核对：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卡组织</th>\n<th>卡不在场（MIT / CIT）</th>\n<th>卡在场（Terminal）</th>\n<th>租赁/住宿可延长至</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Visa</td>\n<td>5 天 / 7 天</td>\n<td>5 天</td>\n<td>30 天（租赁、住宿、邮轮等 MCC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mastercard</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>2 天</td>\n<td>30 天（所有 MCC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>American Express</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>2 天</td>\n<td>30 天（住宿与租车）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discover</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>2 天</td>\n<td>30 天（航司、租车、邮轮等 MCC）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以上为 Stripe 公布的授权有效期表（docs.stripe.com/payments/place-a-hold-on-a-payment-method）。三个工程细节：其一，精确时长比公示值短——Stripe 注明 Visa 扩展窗口精确为 <strong>29 天 18 小时</strong>（为清分留缓冲），2023 年 9 月 Visa 还把标准有效期从 31 天缩到 30 天以防违约网络费；其二，<strong>扩展授权仅对客户发起交易（CIT）开放</strong>，Visa 在非租赁/住宿 MCC 上加收约 0.08% 网络成本，Discover 在 2023 年 9 月取消了设备/家具/家电租赁等 MCC 的扩展资格（docs.stripe.com/payments/extended-authorization）；其三，授权是有上限的额度占用，可用额度按占用集合扣减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>avail</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>limit</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>holds</mtext></mrow></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{avail}} = C_{\\text{limit}} - \\sum_{i \\in \\text{holds}} A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">limit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">holds</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此押金太低覆盖不了损坏、太高把真客户挡在门外，须按资产价值分位、租期与风险分档动态计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">clamp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>asset</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>risk tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\operatorname{clamp}(\\alpha V_{\\text{asset}} + \\beta \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{risk tier}],\\, D_{\\min},\\, D_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">asset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">risk tier</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。结算不是「先扣后退」，而是「归还验损后决定 capture 多少」——金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 授权金额，未请款部分自动释放；租期超出单次窗口时须<strong>续授权或增量授权补足</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"身份核验与-3ds-sca-分层\">身份核验与 3DS/SCA 分层</h2><p>押金能否收回，首先取决于「这个人是不是真的、卡是不是他的」。身份侧与支付侧应分层施加摩擦，而非对所有订单上最重的验证——过重验证会击穿转化率。<strong>支付侧核心是 3D Secure（3DS）</strong>：它在发卡行与持卡人之间插入一次验证，通常是无摩擦（frictionless，银行静默通过）或挑战（challenge，要求 OTP、App 确认或生物识别）。它最重要的价值不是拦截，而是<strong>责任转移（liability shift）</strong>：经 3DS 成功认证的交易，欺诈类拒付的责任通常从商户转移到发卡行（docs.stripe.com/payments/3d-secure），高风险订单多走一次挑战即把「必然输的争议」变成「大概率不成立的争议」。<strong>监管侧是 SCA</strong>：欧盟 PSD2 下的强客户认证自 2019-09-14 生效，EEA、英国、印度、日本、澳大利亚等地有类似要求（docs.stripe.com/strong-customer-authentication）。SCA 有一组可申请的豁免：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SCA 豁免</th>\n<th>适用条件（EUR）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低价值</td>\n<td>单笔 &lt; 30（GBP 25）；且自上次 SCA 以来累计 ≤ 100、笔数 &lt; 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易风险分析 TRA</td>\n<td>单笔 ≤ 100 时 &lt; 0.13%；≤ 250 时 &lt; 0.06%；≤ 500 时 &lt; 0.01%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商户发起交易 MIT</td>\n<td>存卡时已完成认证并持有持卡人授权（mandate）的 off-session 扣款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对租赁极其重要的推论：<strong>续授权或押金扣款若被正确标记为 MIT，可豁免 SCA</strong>，前提是首次存卡完成认证并留有 mandate（授权条款需覆盖发起方式、频率与金额确定方法）；若误判为 CIT 且不做 3DS，很容易被银行拒绝。身份侧则是证件与行为：高价值序列化资产通常要求政府证件核验加活体比对（Stripe Identity 这类服务可校验证件真伪并将证件照与自拍比对），证件号、手机号、设备指纹与押金卡 BIN 的一致度构成强信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"欺诈信号与决策引擎\">欺诈信号与决策引擎</h2><p>决策引擎把离散信号合成可执行动作：放行、加验、拒单。<strong>支付信号</strong>：AVS（账单地址校验）与 CVC 校验是零成本第一关。Stripe 把「已验证账单地址 + 邮编匹配」列为发货类最安全选项，并指出 CVC 校验失败（<code>cvc_check=fail</code>）是拒付抗辩的重要证据（docs.stripe.com/disputes/prevention/best-practices）。取件地与账单地、卡发行国不一致是高价值信号。<strong>速度与设备信号</strong>：同一 IP 多卡下单、同一设备指纹多账户、同一证件短时间多次预订、极短租期叠加高价品类，都是典型攻击形态。规则引擎可按属性表达式直接拦截，语法类似 Stripe Radar：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Block if :ip_country: = &#39;ca&#39; and :card_country: = &#39;ca&#39;&#10;Block if :card_brand: = &#39;visa&#39; and :card_funding: = &#39;prepaid&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Block if :ip_country: = 'ca' and :card_country: = 'ca'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Block if :card_brand: = 'visa' and :card_funding: = 'prepaid'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>预付费卡与虚拟卡额度不可持续、追偿难，在租赁业风险偏高。<strong>身份历史信号</strong>：证件核验结果、历史租还完好率、历史拒付率、账号年龄；首次租赁的高价值订单应默认落入「中风险」，触发加验。<strong>资产侧信号</strong>：可转卖价值、是否带 GPS/远程锁定、是否已投保。输出必须<strong>可解释且可回滚</strong>：每笔拦截记录触发的信号与权重。中风险订单的组合是「提高押金 + 3DS 挑战 + 人工复核 + 延迟请款」；未请款的授权无法被拒付，因此延迟请款让你能在放行资产前撤销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"争议-拒付-与证据链\">争议（拒付）与证据链</h2><p>当风控漏网，争议是最后一道闸门。理解卡组织理由码，才能在设计阶段埋好证据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卡组织</th>\n<th>理由码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>租赁关联</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Visa</td>\n<td>10.4</td>\n<td>其他欺诈：卡不在场</td>\n<td>盗卡线上预订</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visa</td>\n<td>13.1</td>\n<td>商品/服务未收到</td>\n<td>谎称未取到资产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visa</td>\n<td>13.3</td>\n<td>与描述不符/有缺陷</td>\n<td>资产状况争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mastercard</td>\n<td>4837</td>\n<td>无持卡人授权</td>\n<td>典型盗卡争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mastercard</td>\n<td>4855</td>\n<td>交易未完成</td>\n<td>取消/未履约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amex</td>\n<td>F29</td>\n<td>卡不在场欺诈</td>\n<td>线上盗卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amex</td>\n<td>C18</td>\n<td>「No Show」或车辆押金取消</td>\n<td>押金争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amex</td>\n<td>M10</td>\n<td>租车：重大损伤、盗窃、使用损失</td>\n<td>损坏追偿证据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：Stripe 争议理由码分类（docs.stripe.com/disputes/categories）。其一，<strong>租赁损坏追偿走 Amex M10 这类专门理由码，证据要求远高于普通商品争议</strong>——必须有取还时的资产状态证据（照片、序列号、里程/工时、第三方定损单）。其二，<strong>Visa 的 Compelling Evidence 3.0 依赖交易历史</strong>：它用同一持卡人在指定期间内的无争议历史交易反驳「友好欺诈」，因此应把客户 IP、邮箱、取件地址、资产描述等字段尽可能完整地随交易提交。另有两个杠杆：<strong>全额退款的支付无法被拒付</strong>，所以对确定是欺诈且资产尚未交付的订单，主动退款比等争议更划算；<strong>明示的账单描述符</strong>能降低「我不认识这笔交易」类争议。证据链应与资产生命周期绑定：下单记身份与授权、取件记序列号与外观、归还记验损与差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境差异与合规边界\">跨境差异与合规边界</h2><p>跨境租赁把这些机制推到更复杂的边界。<strong>监管分化</strong>：EEA/英国适用 SCA，美国、东南亚多数市场无同等强制，SCA 豁免与 3DS 挑战应做成按发卡国/受理地动态开关。<strong>卡组织规则的地域差异</strong>同样显著：Discover 在 2023 年 9 月取消了多类租赁 MCC 的授权扩展，Diners Club 经 Discover 通道在美国商户可获 30 天延长，银联在美加以外地区为 27–29 天（docs.stripe.com/payments/extended-authorization）；忽略差异会导致长租订单在部分卡上授权提前失效。<strong>授权货币</strong>：押金以资产所在地货币还是持卡人本币授权，影响额度占用与结算金额。<strong>合规是硬约束</strong>：押金与身份数据属于受保护数据，收集前应定好最小字段、保留期限与删除路径；跨境还需注意辖区存储传输要求、制裁名单筛查、以及本地对押金的法律限制。这些约束反向影响押金模型：模型值再被法律上限截断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>租赁欺诈分取件前、履约中/归还、拒付三类，防线分别是<strong>授权阶段身份与支付信号</strong>、<strong>序列号与取还证据链</strong>、<strong>责任转移规则与争议证据</strong>；风控必须前移。</li>\n<li>押金是<strong>延后请款的授权</strong>，持有期不能超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>；Visa 精确扩展窗口为 <strong>29 天 18 小时</strong>，Mastercard/Amex/Discover 在租赁住宿 MCC 可至 30 天，扩展仅对 CIT 开放。</li>\n<li>可用额度按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 扣减，押金按风险分档动态计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，过高会因额度不足挡住真客户。</li>\n<li>3DS 的价值是<strong>责任转移</strong>；SCA 的低价值、TRA（0.13%/0.06%/0.01% 三档）、MIT 三类豁免中，MIT 要求首次存卡完成认证并留有 mandate。- 决策引擎按支付、速度设备、身份历史、资产四组信号合成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，输出必须可解释可回滚。</li>\n<li>争议按卡组织理由码组织证据，Amex M10 这类租赁专属码要求资产状态完整证据；跨境要动态开关 SCA 并让法律上限截断押金模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租赁欺诈识别与押金授权风控","id":"租赁欺诈识别与押金授权风控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：租赁欺诈的三类风险面","id":"核心概念-租赁欺诈的三类风险面"},{"level":2,"text":"押金授权：延后请款与授权有效期","id":"押金授权-延后请款与授权有效期"},{"level":2,"text":"身份核验与 3DS/SCA 分层","id":"身份核验与-3ds-sca-分层"},{"level":2,"text":"欺诈信号与决策引擎","id":"欺诈信号与决策引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"争议（拒付）与证据链","id":"争议-拒付-与证据链"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境差异与合规边界","id":"跨境差异与合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分时阶梯定价与押金授权模型：从边际价格折扣到可撤销的押金冻结","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/booking-pricing-deposit-risk/duration-tiered-pricing-deposit-authorization"},"next":{"title":"出库交付与归还回收逆向物流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/fulfillment-reverse-asset-lifecycle/outbound-delivery-inbound-return-logistics"}}